Dunder Mifflin is looking for bright, energetic paper people to open up their own branch and become part of the Dunder Mifflin family.
邓德·米夫林公司正在寻找聪明、充满活力的造纸人才，来开设他们自己的分公司，并成为邓德·米夫林大家庭的一员。

262
00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.770
Interested in your own future?
对你自己的未来感兴趣吗？

263
00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:20.050
Go to DunderMifflinInfinity.com to find out more.
访问 DunderMifflinInfinity.com 了解更多信息。

264
00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.310
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

265
00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.250
Isn't that great?
这难道不棒吗？

266
00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.310
And I asked Joya who did that voiceover.
我问了乔亚是谁做的配音。

267
00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:26.610
And she said, that's just a voiceover actor that they hired.
她说，那只是他们雇佣的一位配音演员。

268
00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:33.910
She has a whole page on her website, joyabalfour.com, where you can look at Dunder Mifflin Infinity and what all they did with it.
她在自己的网站 joyabalfour.com 上有一个专门的页面，你可以在那里查看邓德·米夫林无限公司以及他们所做的一切。

269
00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:36.890
You can actually watch that video that we just played for you.
你实际上可以观看我们刚才为你播放的那个视频。

270
00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:43.510
And I told Joya, over the next few episodes, the next few seasons, I'm going to reach out to her, kind of like your Kentopedia,
我告诉乔亚，在接下来的几集、接下来的几季里，我会联系她，就像你的“肯特百科”一样，

271
00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:47.890
because I really started becoming a more active participant on NBC.com.
因为我真的开始在 NBC.com 上成为一个更积极的参与者了。

272
00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.930
I did a thing called Adventures with Angela.
我做了一个叫《安吉拉历险记》的东西。

273
00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:52.310
We had the Accountants webisodes.
我们还有《会计师》网络短剧。

274
00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.890
There were a lot more fun things we started to do.
我们开始做很多更有趣的事情了。

275
00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:56.450
And I'm going to hit her up along the way.
我会在接下来的过程中联系她。

276
00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:57.550
I love that.
我喜欢这个主意。

277
00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.190
They should relaunch this.
他们应该重新推出这个。

278
00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:02.590
They should relaunch Dunder Mifflin Infinity as an app.
他们应该把“邓德·米夫林无限”作为一款应用程序重新推出。

279
00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:03.070
I know.
我知道。

280
00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.330
And you can do all these same things.
而且你可以做所有这些同样的事情。

281
00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:08.990
Someone, Joya, I don't know, who does this?
有人，乔亚，我不知道，谁来做这个？

282
00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:10.970
Peacock, get on it.
Peacock，赶紧行动起来。

283
00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.670
Peacock, are you listening?
Peacock，你在听吗？

284
00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:13.630
Do this.
做这个吧。

285
00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.090
Yeah.
是啊。

286
00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:17.250
Well, lady, listen, I think we should take a break.
好吧，女士，听着，我觉得我们该休息一下了。

287
00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.610
Those were incredible fast facts.
那些真是令人难以置信的速览事实。

288
00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:23.110
We are killing it today and giving us compliments.
我们今天表现太棒了，还在互相夸奖。

289
00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:28.310
But let's take a break, and then we'll come back and get into this episode.
但让我们休息一下，然后回来继续讨论这一集。

290
00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:31.230
Okay, great, because I've got more details, lady.
好的，太棒了，因为我还有更多细节，女士。

291
00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:32.410
More details.
更多细节。

292
00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:36.910
I know I'm not Kentopedia, but maybe I'm Kinseypedia on this one.
我知道我不是“肯特百科”，但也许这次我是“金赛百科”。

293
00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:39.090
Kinseypedia after the break.
休息过后就是“金赛百科”时间。

294
00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:39.990
Kinseypedia.
“金赛百科”。

295
00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:55.540
All right, we are back, and we open this episode in the break room where there is no more heartbreak.
好了，我们回来了，这一集开场是在休息室，那里已经没有心碎了。

296
00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:59.160
In fact, there is flirty flirt cuteness in there.
事实上，里面充满了调情和可爱。

297
00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:01.720
In fact, I'm pretty sure it's now called the flirt room.
事实上，我很确定它现在被称为“调情室”了。

298
00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:02.900
I think you're right.
我想你是对的。

299
00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:03.980
Jim and Pam.
吉姆和帕姆。

